<title>UK: Hanson to redeem 500 mln stg bond due 2006.</title>
<headline>Hanson to redeem 500 mln stg bond due 2006.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanson Plc's 500 million stg Eurobond due April 2006 will be redeemed after bondholders agreed the move at a special meeting on Wednesday, Hanson said in a statement.</p>
<p>Separately, BZW said it would organise the repurchase of the 10.00 percent bonds as part of Hanson's debt restructuring.</p>
<p>The repurchase price was set at 110.6056.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
